# Radius Manager - diagnostic Starlink, MikroTik et réseau local toutes les 30 secondes
* * * * * root /usr/bin/php /var/www/html/scripts/monitor_network_quality.php >/dev/null 2>&1
* * * * * root /bin/sleep 30 && /usr/bin/php /var/www/html/scripts/monitor_network_quality.php >/dev/null 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/bin/php /var/www/html/scripts/monitor_mikrotik_traffic.php >/dev/null 2>&1
